      "title": "Destroy action exempted from admin check",
      "description": "The change adds destroy to the except list of require_admin. Any authenticated user can now call DELETE /users/:id on any id. Any user with a token can delete every other account, including admins. Remove destroy from the except list so only admins can delete users.",
      "suggested_change": "  before_action :require_admin, except: [:index, :show, :profile]",
