      "title": "Profile update permits every attribute",
      "description": "The profile action permits all user params, so the caller can set any column on their own record. ApplicationController trusts the admin and api_token columns of that record for authorization. Any user can make themselves an admin or overwrite their api_token. That escalates to full admin access. Permit only the fields a user may edit, such as email.",
